pygeofilter-duckdb
https://github.com/Terradue/pygeofilter-duckdb

This project is derived from pygeofilter-duckdb by DLR-terrabyte:
https://github.com/DLR-terrabyte/pygeofilter-duckdb

The Terradue fork adapts the original implementation into a standalone
library, updates DuckDB support, adds STAC/GeoParquet examples, and uses
Hatch for project management.

